  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘 실험은 물과 에탄올이 섞여있을 때,<br>두 물질의 끓는 점 차이를 활용하여, 혼합물을 분리하는 실험입니다!<br>교과서에도 굉장히 많이 나오는 실험이죠ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/797345784961934d2a063cba4d35abbede79278e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/797345784961934d2a063cba4d35abbede79278e\" data-origin-width=\"1028\" data-origin-height=\"1471\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86204009b92da46841b1e5c5596115a37858c702\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86204009b92da46841b1e5c5596115a37858c702\" data-origin-width=\"1026\" data-origin-height=\"1479\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">혼합물의 온도를 보면서, 추출되어 나오는 물질을<br>따로 모아주는 것이 핵심입니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/465bcfdd717a8e7b07c5f28874a8ef052f804fec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/465bcfdd717a8e7b07c5f28874a8ef052f804fec\" data-origin-width=\"1030\" data-origin-height=\"1482\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5144144c58a60cf41e3637c997c9edcb9dc1eb92\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5144144c58a60cf41e3637c997c9edcb9dc1eb92\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1479\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">내일 또 다른 실험으로 돌아올게요!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr11